    <string name="nwd_doors_help">When a door opens, Car Info shows its own window with the car from above, over Cockpit. Cockpit already turns its own car to the open door, so that window can go. Only ADB can switch it off, once, and it stays off (as long as Car Info is not reset):\n\nsettings put system %1$s 1\n\nTo bring it back: the same with 0.</string>
